  (text "PR #12 — Z4 ACTUADORES / FOOTPRINT CLOSURE PR #13\nFuente de verdad: hardware/z4_production_netlist.json\nContrato: hardware/z4_actuator_contract.json\nBOM: bom/insight_z4_production_bom.csv"
