  (text "BOMBA / DRV8242H-Q1\nU_PUMP_DRV = DRV8242HQRHLRQ1, 12V_ACT, PH/EN.\nD5/PUMP_PWM -> EN; D6/PUMP_DIR -> PH. MODE=GND, SR=22k, DIAG=GND, ITRIP=GND.\nIPROPI -> A4/PUMP_CURRENT_ADC por R_PUMP_IPROPI=1.5k + C_PUMP_IPROPI=100nF.\nnFAULT -> D10/ACT_FAULT_N. J_PUMP = PUMP_OUT1/PUMP_OUT2.\nPR13 footprint = NFB:TI_RHL0020B_DRV8242; thermal pad 21 -> GND."
    (exclude_from_sim no)
    (at 30.48 76.2 0)
    (effects (font (size 1.35 1.35)) (justify left bottom))
    (uuid "1b6ae4ce-77f3-4aed-a24a-b9eacfb09e61")
  )
  (text "SOLENOIDE CO2 / TPS1HC120C-Q1\nU_CO2_DRV = TPS1HC120CQDYCRQ1 smart high-side.\nD7/CO2_SOL_CTL -> EN; R_CO2_ILIM=27k -> ~0.5A.\nFLT1 -> ACT_FAULT_N; FLT2 -> CO2_OPENLOAD_N + TP.\nClamp inductivo integrado; NO flyback discreto poblado.\nPR13 footprint = NFB:TI_DYC0008A_TPS1HC120; 8 pads, NO PowerPAD."
    (exclude_from_sim no)
    (at 30.48 127 0)
    (effects (font (size 1.35 1.35)) (justify left bottom))
    (uuid "73e1a7bb-4069-4248-9c35-c735883021ea")
  )
  (text "CHILLER / CONTACTO SECO\nU_CHILLER = Panasonic AQY212EHAX PhotoMOS 1 Form A.\nD8/CHILLER_CTL -> Q_CHILLER 2N7002 -> LED PhotoMOS.\nR_CH_LED=360R: >=5mA al peor Vf contractual.\nJ_CHILLER_CTL = contacto flotante CHILLER_CONTACT_A/B, SELV <=48V solamente.\nNO MAINS. La potencia del chiller NO atraviesa la PCBA.\nPR13 footprint = NFB:Panasonic_AQY212EHAX_DIP4_SMD."
    (exclude_from_sim no)
    (at 30.48 177.8 0)
    (effects (font (size 1.35 1.35)) (justify left bottom))
    (uuid "75cfd8f7-0735-45bf-83e2-d81480604412")
  )
  (text "DIAGNÓSTICO\nD10/pad25 = ACT_FAULT_N active-low wired-OR.\nContribuyen U_PUMP_DRV.nFAULT y U_CO2_DRV.FLT1; pull-up 10k a 3V3_RAIL.\nA4/pad13 = PUMP_CURRENT_ADC; CO2_ADC permanece retirado.\nD9 continúa DNP/Reserva; no proportional CO2 PWM."
